<title>HUNGARY: Hungary sugar content down to 14.1 pct at 5th test.</title>
<headline>Hungary sugar content down to 14.1 pct at 5th test.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sugar content at Hungary's fifth beet test of the 1996/97 campaign was down to 14.1 percent from 14.3 percent in the fifth test in last year's campaign, the Sugar Industry Association (SIA) said on Friday.  </p>
<p>						  1996/97     1995/96</p>
<p> Average sugar weight (grams/root)     120.70	 92.24</p>
<p> Sugar content per beet (pct)	     14.1	  14.3</p>
<p> Average weight of roots (grams/root)  856	   659</p>
<p> Average leaf weight (grams/root)	477	   295</p>
<p>The results were based on 158 samples taken on September 23.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327-4040</p>
</text>
